<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS TO CUT STAKE IN ASM LITHO .</title>
<headline>PHILIPS TO CUT STAKE IN ASM LITHO .</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Thursday it planned to sell 3.95 million ordinary shares in ASM Lithography by means of a public offering.</p>
<p>It said the move would reduce its stake in ASML Lithography to 23.9 percent from 35.4 percent at present.</p>
